    "overview": "<p>The Beast, first fielded in the Word of Blake Protectorate, is an anti-riot vehicle equipped to handle extreme crises. Its weapons include a turret-mounted flamer, a front-mounted grenade launcher, and a driver-operated grenade launcher system, generally equipped with non-lethal ammunition but adaptable to deadly use. The large, well-armored vehicle can transport two full squads of infantry and detain up to seven apprehended individuals.</p>",
